Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.59,0:00:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.05,0:00:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.75,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.01,0:00:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:00:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them with\Nyou. Our love's so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.89,0:01:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't even want to live?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.32,0:01:55.24,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)\blur0.8\bord1.9\fsp-1\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\4a&HFF&\t(755,800,\1a&H00&)}It Begins
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.32,0:01:55.24,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)\blur0.8\bord0\fsp-1\c&HFAFAF9&\4a&HFF&}It Begins
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:01:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.59,0:01:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.50,0:02:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.20,0:02:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I crossed an ocean and it didn't\Nknow what to kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.07,0:02:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not gonna make it come\Nout here, you loudmouthed dope!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.65,0:02:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, we're dealing\Nwith this country's hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.11,0:02:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to turn all these\Ncustomers against us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.65,0:02:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.56,0:02:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.77,0:02:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without Phoebe, we don't even\Nknow what Crocodile looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.89,0:02:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, where is Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.61,0:02:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.44,0:02:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your pardon, sir, but some\Nundesirables have entered the casino.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.65,0:02:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, for heaven's sake, have security\Nthrow them out and relax, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey you know what i'm\Nthinking they might not
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.57,0:03:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come just because we call\Ni've got you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.59,0:03:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Smoker you\Nthink you could stroll in
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.35,0:03:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anywhere you like and i\Nwill find you not old.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoky oh great what's that\Nrefugee from an ashtray
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.41,0:03:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doing in a casino at rain base\Nif you ask me i'd say he's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.43,0:03:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,developed a special affection\Nfor luffy here he's building
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.07,0:03:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surrounded by a lake,\Nthere's no way to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.41,0:03:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.71,0:03:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.81,0:03:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Government officials\Naren't allowed inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.77,0:03:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must leave at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.67,0:03:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, he's stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.71,0:03:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in no mood to try to\Ndeal with this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.19,0:03:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.95,0:03:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to ask\Nyou and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.13,0:03:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I just hit something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.41,0:03:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manager, this is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.11,0:03:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some strange people have\Nforced their way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.85,0:03:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send them to the VIP room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:03:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile's been expecting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.71,0:04:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! Ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.15,0:04:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.53,0:04:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please step this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The VIP lounge welcomes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.47,0:04:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he say the VIP lounge? Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.25,0:04:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it could be a trap, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.81,0:04:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't these lounge deals usually\Nhave free drinks for their guests?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.37,0:04:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like we have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.81,0:04:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A VIP lounge?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.15,0:04:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me these chokers\Nare friends with Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it's true, all of them could\Nend up on the gallows together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.53,0:04:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is a biff anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.85,0:04:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, the hall splits!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says VIPs go left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.57,0:04:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And pirates go right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.05,0:04:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which way do we go? Decide, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.91,0:04:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,VIPs, choose VIPs, that's\Ngotta be the way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.45,0:04:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's crazy talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're pirates, and pirates\Nare supposed to go this way!
