Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.81,0:04:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.97,0:04:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is certainly unexpected!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we fell\Nfor the soul for three.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.89,0:05:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an outbreak of my old, I end up\Nswimming when I fall into a dark fantasy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty clever trap, wasn't it? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way to see that one coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.57,0:05:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you it was a\Ntrap in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.61,0:05:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what a\Ncouple of idiots you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.95,0:05:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.25,0:05:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel weak all of a sudden. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.99,0:05:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.97,0:05:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take you on if you\Nwant, you smoke-filled freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.15,0:05:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't do so bad\Nagainst the bomb guy you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.09,0:05:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know so I'll just wait\Nover here in the corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you let me know\Nwhen you're ready, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.07,0:05:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like when I fall into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.79,0:06:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, just what\Nhave you done to Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tip of this staff is made from\Na substance called Sea Prism Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.79,0:06:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a rare mineral.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It supposedly exists in one certain\Nsea in the distant corner of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.89,0:06:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not much is known about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.19,0:06:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's believed to\Ngive off mystical energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.07,0:06:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the same wavelength\Nas the ocean itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Basically, you can think of\Nit as a solid form of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.57,0:06:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it affects Luffy the same\Nas if he fell in the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prison cells at marine headquarters are\Nmade of the same substance to prevent
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.57,0:06:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,criminals who possess any Devil Fruit\Npowers from successfully escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then I'm betting this\Ncell is built the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't, you could be\Nsure I'd be long gone by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.81,0:06:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you four would be on your way to prison\Nwaiting for your date with the hangman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in fighting\Nin a situation like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.11,0:06:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.27,0:06:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, what good is a sword\Nagainst a guy who's made out of smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.13,0:06:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.35,0:07:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all going to die together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why not make an effort\Nto get along first?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.81,0:07:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, it's Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.69,0:07:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's one of the seven warlords, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.51,0:07:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're every bit the\Nlow-life sea scum I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.67,0:07:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're every bit the wild\Ndog I heard you were, Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.31,0:07:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike your superiors, you've never really\Nbelieved I was on your side, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.59,0:07:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And of course, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.55,0:07:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Smoker, I have a feeling\Nyou'll die briefly in the line of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be more than happy to inform\Nthe government that you put
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up a valiant fight against the\Nvicious straw-hat pirate here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't the vaguest idea what\Nreally brought you to this country,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.15,0:08:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm betting you're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.23,0:08:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We both know the government would\Nnever order you to come to this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.81,0:08:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have every confidence\Nin me, a warlord of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You big old bag of wind, you crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.85,0:08:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on and fight me\Nlike a man, you big dup!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay attention, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.25,0:08:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta remember not to touch the bars!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strawhat Luffy, I congratulate\Nyou on getting this far,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.57,0:08:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I promise to dispose of\Nyou neatly and efficiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.15,0:08:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once our special guest of honor\Nhas made her appearance. A guest?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, even as we speak, my partner\Nis on the way to fetch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to waste time\Nwith these second-rate thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.01,0:08:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got some pretty impressive\Nmoves there, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.27,0:09:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta tell ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.25,0:09:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I'd expect no less\Nfrom a former frontier agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.43,0:09:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't you think it's\Ntime you accepted your fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.27,0:09:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get away and reach the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.49,0:09:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fun time's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boss is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.43,0:09:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.73,0:09:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.05,0:09:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a falcon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A falcon with a machine gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.77,0:09:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and shoot it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.47,0:10:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap! The princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pel, I can't believe it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.93,0:10:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very good to see you, Princess Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'll please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.09,0:10:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't mean Pel the Falcon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.47,0:10:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.81,0:10:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the strongest warrior\Nin the entire country!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bird bird fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Model the Falcon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just five types in the world\Nhave the power of flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.37,0:10:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power to which you\Nwill now bear witness!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.71,0:10:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot your foals and don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.77,0:10:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.81,0:10:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:10:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.27,0:11:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.91,0:11:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're getting\Na bit ahead of yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've certainly been a thorn in our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.27,0:11:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This all Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.91,0:11:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like our precious\Nemployees are no longer of much use.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Miss Vice President.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.03,0:11:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone who had\Nthe power of flight before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.65,0:11:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, do you think that\Nyou're stronger than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.47,0:11:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi, this arrogant girl—is she\None of those threatening our homeland?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.87,0:11:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm simply here as a messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To invite the princess to a\Nlittle gathering at our mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.55,0:11:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have no objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm afraid the princess\Nhas a prior engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.63,0:11:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.31,0:11:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop screwing with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.15,0:11:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now really, do you think it's proper for\Na princess To use such coarse language?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.55,0:11:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dearness Wednesday
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.43,0:12:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Igaram you killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Igaram?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.58,0:12:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah yes, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eight, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.49,0:12:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.40,0:12:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who killed him was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh come now, why are you\Ngetting so worked up about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.93,0:12:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really no different from what\Nyou did to our employees just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.53,0:12:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be childish!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.27,0:12:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your moment will be the sand of Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.79,0:12:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really trace floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.13,0:12:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi, you're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, did it look to you\Nas if I'd killed the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:12:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.69,0:13:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ought to lighten up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.55,0:13:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was only teasing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have Devil Fruit powers,\Nit's the only explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.23,0:13:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ate the flower flower fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power to make body\Nparts bloom like flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.59,0:13:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is my ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with the power of flight,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.01,0:13:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you cannot escape my reach, for\Nmy limbs can bloom anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.87,0:13:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's escaping?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.33,0:13:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm staying right here, and taking\Nvengeance for the life of Igaram!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.97,0:13:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.71,0:13:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to play a few\Nmore hands with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But time doesn't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.61,0:13:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.71,0:13:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power. Speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.97,0:13:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These things mean nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My reach is limitless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.43,0:14:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was he really Alabasta's\Ngreatest warrior? How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.29,0:14:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.61,0:14:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.31,0:14:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our boss is waiting to see us,\Nand so are all your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.27,0:14:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inside a prison cell at rain dinners.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.99,0:14:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, I'm Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.07,0:14:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, which one of you ate the meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.49,0:14:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.21,0:14:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you two screw around when\Nwe're in this desperate situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.77,0:14:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't get out, so what\Nelse is there for us to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.57,0:14:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that we can't get out\Nis the reason it's so desperate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.33,0:14:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something soon,\Nwe're gonna wind up dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.49,0:15:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where are you sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.43,0:15:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is it morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.39,0:15:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's afternoon, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.21,0:15:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're certainly a\Nhigh-spirited young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.51,0:15:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better go ahead and enjoy yourself\Nwhile you've still got the time, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.67,0:15:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because when these fellas get out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're going to kick\Nyour smug butt up and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,down the Grand Line like\Na flabby beach ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Luffy? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.11,0:15:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better believe we will, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your crew members seem to place a lot of\Ntrust in your talents, Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.61,0:15:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.79,0:15:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think trust is completely unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.61,0:15:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who does he think he is,\Nsneering at us like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.25,0:15:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just going to\Nend up making him angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.05,0:15:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.01,0:15:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.43,0:15:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My humble greetings, Vivi,\NRoyal Princess of Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.23,0:15:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, Miss Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I compliment you on having evaded our\Nassassins in order to get this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.67,0:16:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've no idea what I'd do, or how far\NI would go to see you dead, Mr. Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.71,0:16:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish that you died in\Nyour cradle, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.11,0:16:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,B. B., wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.27,0:16:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First get us out of this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.81,0:16:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This country would still be\Npeaceful if it weren't for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.89,0:16:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.61,0:16:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peacock String Slasher!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.21,0:16:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.99,0:16:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel better as a native of this\Ncountry, you must surely know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.81,0:16:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I have the power of the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.51,0:16:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sand Sand. Want to become a mummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.29,0:16:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a seat
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,princess I trust
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll be comfortable there I must
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.05,0:16:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say your timing is perfect.\NThe party is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.43,0:17:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Miss\NAllsunday? Yes. Party?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.53,0:17:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's exactly noon right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.01,0:17:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for Operation Utopia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.17,0:17:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Utopia?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.79,0:17:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's an Operation Utopia?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.11,0:17:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.33,0:17:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will mean the demise of the\NKingdom of Alabasta this Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.87,0:17:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to wipe it off the face\Nof the map as if it never was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.13,0:17:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All people, great and small,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.75,0:17:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be sucked into eternal\Ndarkness as they writhe in agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let Operation Utopia begin!

